# forge/cut/crackled: MYTHIC's crackle (28.4 10): jagged hairline cracks two steps down through the blackened plate, one
# branching crack per 8 x 6 cell, connected diagonally, never dots; the cracks are seams (N), so the Mythic's T6 runes
# burn along them: cracked with fire.
# FORGE-MARKS, forge i2 (tools: emb_P2c/forge/areas/FORGE-MARKS/tools2/mk2.py). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# CUT TILE (P2C_CONTRACTS 3c `overlay cut.<v>`, `on-slot <slot>` kept as the tag on-slot:<slot>): laid by forgeView over
# that slot's lit pixels (step 1-4) on the body's armour, hang and pauldron views (not the style's own `when cut-<v>`
# drawing, not R G W). Ink cells move the step by k - 2 and stay inside 1..4: `+` +1, `^` +2, `:` -1, `=` -2 (the seam),
# `.` keeps; the regions plane sets the pixel's region (N: the seam, which takes the T6 runes and the glowing tell; R
# rim; P panel). Seams are `=` with a `:` hot point every third or fourth cell: on a glowing alloy (N -> Glow from T4)
# the hot points keep step 2 or more and read as embers along the seam. The tile rides the view's origin (the part's
# anchor). Every pattern is 3 px or more in period, a line never a speck: the read is structure at 1x (STYLE_P2 28.9).
# (FORGE-MARKS forge i3) crackled: dark plates parted by a network of 2-4 px cracks with jogs (N, lit amber on the Mythic); no lone pixel.
use person
role overlay cut.crackled
tags tile overlay on-slot:metal
legend + ink 3
legend ^ ink 4
legend : ink 1
legend = ink 0
legend O metal2 2
legend n accent 1
legend o accent 2
legend p accent 3
# (forge fix i2, MATERIAL; the owner: "Mythic lost in 1 px speckle") one long jagged crack a 12 x 9 cell, its runs 3-5 px
# with diagonal jogs, so the T6 runes burn along a few long fissures instead of a dash in every 8 x 6 cell.

view D key rest origin 0 0
|..=.........
|..=.........
|...==.......
|.....=......
|.....=====..
|.........=..
|=.........=.
|.=.........=
|.=..........
regions
|..N.........
|..N.........
|...NN.......
|.....N......
|.....NNNNN..
|.........N..
|N.........N.
|.N.........N
|.N..........
